# Demand Tribute (thunk_FUN_1000_a5f4, src/core/ai_contact_actions.c ai_contact_demand_tribute) from three Scouts.
# Start: village_scout_visit's input.sav, fixture-edited through sav_json and re-saved through one no-op replay:
#  - the 17 Tupi braves (nation 11) handed to the Sioux (nation 10), census rows included (Tupi slot 7
#    0x9184 / 0x91cc[cont 1] 255 -> 0, Sioux slot 6 64 -> 255), so the Tupi side of the roll is
#    indian = (0 + 0) * 2 + alarm/2 = 0;
#  - Tupi village 62 (41,27) has tribute_paid (bit 0x10) set;
#  - Arawak (indians[2]) alarm for France 80; Scout 134 moved from (36,24) to (36,16), south of the Arawak capital (36,15).
# The strengths are the census rows, not live sums: France's euro = 0x95b2[1*16+1] 8 + 0x941c[1] 108 >> 1 = 62.
# RNG: each demand draws rand(0,euro) then rand(0,indian) from the game stream (RTST RNG record moves).
#  - village 31: indian 0, win = rand(0,62) > 0, and this stream draws 0: no win, but indian < euro and
#    alarm < 50, so @EXTORTPOOR, bump 0.
#  - village 62: already paid and indian (0) < euro, alarm < 50: @EXTORTPOOR whatever the roll, bump 0.
#  - Arawak capital: alarm 80 >= 75: @EXTORTLAUGH whatever the roll, bump 5 halved = +2.
# Every pick forfeits the Scout's moves (FUN_4d56_4528 tail).
key KP_8     # Scout 129 at (43,24) steps north into Tupi village 31 (43,23): menu Speak With Chief / Demand Tribute / Attack Village / Cancel Action
key Down     # select Demand Tribute
key Return   # @EXTORTPOOR "no gifts worthy of your magnificence": nothing given, alarm unchanged
key Return   # dismiss; Scout 130 is selected
key KP_4     # Seasoned Scout 130 at (42,27) steps west into village 62 (41,27, tribute already paid): menu
key Down
key Return   # @EXTORTPOOR "no gifts worthy of your magnificence": nothing given, alarm unchanged
key Return   # dismiss; Scout 134 is selected
key KP_8     # Scout 134 at (36,16) steps north into the Arawak capital (36,15): the angry greeting ("war drums"), same menu
key Down
key Return   # @EXTORTLAUGH "We laugh at your puny threats": Arawak alarm 80 -> 82
key Return   # dismiss; no Scout left with moves, Colonist 88 in Guadeloupe is selected
